Wait, I was thinking...

918
00:43:01,698 --> 00:43:03,198
でっかいの居るかな？でっかいの...
Wonder if there's a big one? A big one...

919
00:43:03,198 --> 00:43:04,698
そいつ生きてんのか...
Is that thing alive...?

920
00:43:06,898 --> 00:43:09,398
首長がいいかなー
A long-neck would be nice~

921
00:43:12,898 --> 00:43:14,398
