Ah, do we have some too?

1049
00:49:17,239 --> 00:49:18,239
あ、鳥？
Ah, the bird?

1050
00:49:18,239 --> 00:49:20,739
じゃ、ちょ、我々も取りに行くか。
Then, wait, should we go get it too?

1051
00:49:21,539 --> 00:49:23,239
いやー、ばっか...
Man, crazy...

1052
00:49:23,539 --> 00:49:25,539
うさぎがいっぱい！
There are so many bunnies!

1053
