Wait, this thing cooks it into grilled meat!

1094
00:51:41,087 --> 00:51:42,287
そうですね
That's right.

1095
00:51:42,287 --> 00:51:43,887
そう、焼き肉になるんだよ
Yeah, it cooks it into grilled meat.

1096
00:51:43,887 --> 00:51:45,087
なっちゃう
It really does.

1097
00:51:45,087 --> 00:51:46,387
かわいいけど
Cute, though.

1098
00:51:47,487 --> 00:51:48,487
よいしょ
There.

1099
00:51:49,887 --> 00:51:50,887
毛皮…
Fur...

1100
00:51:50,887 --> 00:51:52,587
ちょっと待ってね
Hold on a sec.

1101
00:51:54,887 --> 00:51:56,887
さっきユウティ…
Earlier, the Yuty...

1102
00:51:57,287 --> 00:51:58,887
HP…
Its HP...

1103
00:52:00,587 --> 00:52:03,587
一番HP低いんだよね
